WEBVTT

00:00:24.220 --> 00:00:26.830
You will feel my power!

00:00:26.830 --> 00:00:28.720
Darkness Thunder!

00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:45.260
Majiha Pink, there is no light 
of hope remaining for you!

00:00:45.980 --> 00:00:47.290
You're wrong!

00:00:47.560 --> 00:00:48.730
Behold!

00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:00.920
Majiha Purple!

00:01:00.920 --> 00:01:02.920
Basashi! Gyuusashi!

00:01:02.920 --> 00:01:05.840
Do you still wish to continue?

00:01:05.840 --> 00:01:07.120
Give it up!

00:01:07.770 --> 00:01:09.200
It's over!

00:01:12.920 --> 00:01:18.540
I, Demon King Lukifel, will rule this 
world with the darkness of despair.

00:01:18.540 --> 00:01:20.800
This is the beginning of 
the darkest of nights,

00:01:20.800 --> 00:01:24.870
in which I suck up the dreams of 
all children around the world!

00:01:31.310 --> 00:01:32.700
I won't give up.

00:01:42.810 --> 00:01:45.850
I won't let you do that.

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:48.940
No matter what happens, I...

00:01:49.420 --> 00:01:53.550
We, the Majiha Sisters, will never give up!

00:02:10.370 --> 00:02:13.720
Because we believe in the future!

00:02:18.780 --> 00:02:21.170
<i>I can feel you, Majiha Purple.</i>

00:02:22.110 --> 00:02:23.870
We believe in love!

00:02:27.150 --> 00:02:29.570
The light of hope will never disappear.

00:02:29.940 --> 00:02:31.380
It's always burning...

00:02:31.690 --> 00:02:33.400
...right here!

00:02:34.010 --> 00:02:35.600
With my crimson flame...

00:02:35.600 --> 00:02:37.120
...I will burn all!

00:02:38.110 --> 00:02:40.750
Majiha Fire!

