00:04:21.990 --> 00:04:26.990
Episode 11

00:04:21.990 --> 00:04:26.990
<b>Majiha Forever</b>

00:04:23.540 --> 00:04:25.430
"Majiha Forever."

00:04:28.270 --> 00:04:29.550
<i>When I was little,</i>

00:04:29.910 --> 00:04:33.090
<i>the Majiha Sisters were my role models.</i>

00:04:33.470 --> 00:04:36.440
<i>Love and friendship, courage and hope...</i>

00:04:36.890 --> 00:04:41.600
<i>I believed that if I had those, I could be 
an awesome magical girl and save the world.</i>

00:04:42.740 --> 00:04:44.990
Majiha... Fire.

00:04:46.390 --> 00:04:50.620
Of course... there's no 
way I could ever be one.

00:04:51.270 --> 00:04:53.670
<i>I knew my own limitations.</i>

00:04:57.470 --> 00:05:02.140
<i>I protected myself by hanging out 
with people who were stronger.</i>

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:04.820
<b>A girl who puts on a nice act around boys!!</b>

00:05:02.710 --> 00:05:04.820
<i>I talked trash about them 
behind their backs,</i>

00:05:05.170 --> 00:05:07.730
<i>but when we ended up with a common enemy,</i>

00:05:07.750 --> 00:05:09.370
<i>I'd cling to them.</i>

00:05:12.350 --> 00:05:14.870
<i>They all did the same thing...</i>

00:05:14.870 --> 00:05:18.070
<i>so I didn't have any right to complain.</i>

00:05:18.890 --> 00:05:21.250
<i>You've gotta be able to 
read the room to get by.</i>

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:23.760
<i>What's so wrong about that?</i>

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:27.050
Like I could ever be a magical 
girl of love and hope.

00:05:55.240 --> 00:05:57.580
I... revived?

00:05:59.890 --> 00:06:03.180
<i>When that happened, 
I was sure it was all over.</i>

00:06:06.520 --> 00:06:07.730
Where am I?

00:06:15.900 --> 00:06:18.230
So falling down here and dying

00:06:18.230 --> 00:06:21.090
allowed me to maintain my body 
heat so I could revive?

00:06:23.610 --> 00:06:26.080
Is this a secret dungeon?

00:06:26.080 --> 00:06:27.530
Interesting.

00:06:32.460 --> 00:06:36.320
Wasn't expecting to find a place like 
this in the mountains, though.

00:06:49.170 --> 00:06:54.100
