00:07:01.490 --> 00:07:04.250
No... Why?

00:07:04.850 --> 00:07:07.060
Come on, wake up!

00:07:08.660 --> 00:07:09.790
Please...

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:11.510
I'm begging you!

00:07:11.510 --> 00:07:14.210
Please don't die out here!

00:07:15.550 --> 00:07:19.000
Crap! I completely spaced 
out for a second...

00:07:19.290 --> 00:07:21.920
<b>Hakozaki Kusue</b>

00:07:19.290 --> 00:07:21.920
<b>Dead</b>

00:07:19.290 --> 00:07:21.920
<b>Reviving in</b>

00:07:20.540 --> 00:07:21.910
Kusue?

00:07:23.850 --> 00:07:27.520
I'm completing this garbage quest 
if it's the last thing I do!

00:07:31.000 --> 00:07:35.600
I should've been verifying my direction 
like this from the start.

00:07:35.600 --> 00:07:37.710
The wind has calmed down a lot.

00:07:37.710 --> 00:07:41.650
Honestly, walking is still tiring 
me out just as much, but still...

00:07:45.510 --> 00:07:47.990
Oh, thank God! A village!

00:07:51.290 --> 00:07:52.820
It really is a village!

00:07:53.080 --> 00:07:55.730
<i>If I can make it there,
I should be able to borrow</i>

00:07:55.730 --> 00:07:58.660
<i>a carriage or sleigh or something 
that's faster than walking!</i>

00:07:59.170 --> 00:08:02.590
<i>Hang tight, Kusue. 
I'll bring you back in no time!</i>

00:08:10.640 --> 00:08:13.270
<i>Yotsuya-kun and Yuka-san 
are still alive, too.</i>

00:08:16.770 --> 00:08:19.180
<i>Almost there... almost there...</i>

00:08:21.340 --> 00:08:22.990
<i>If we all keep trying...</i>

00:08:33.580 --> 00:08:35.380
You've gotta be kidding me!

00:08:46.210 --> 00:08:49.130
<b>Hakozaki Kusue</b>

00:08:46.210 --> 00:08:49.130
<b>Dead</b>

00:08:46.210 --> 00:08:49.130
<b>Reviving in</b>

00:08:46.210 --> 00:08:49.130
<b>Shindou Iu</b>

00:08:46.210 --> 00:08:49.130
<b>Dead</b>

00:08:46.210 --> 00:08:49.130
<b>Reviving in</b>

00:08:47.140 --> 00:08:48.400
Seriously?

00:08:49.130 --> 00:08:50.540
Shindou-san...

00:08:50.550 --> 00:08:57.470
<b>►Traverse 5% of the map (currently 4.994%)</b>

00:08:50.550 --> 00:08:57.470
<b>►Deliver the goods to Radodorbo</b>

00:08:50.550 --> 00:08:57.470
<b>Time remaining: approx. 3 hours</b>

00:08:50.760 --> 00:08:52.380
<i>She had stopped at one point,</i>

00:08:52.380 --> 00:08:55.000
<i>but after that, it seemed like 
she was making progress again.</i>

00:08:55.000 --> 00:08:57.160
<i>Frankly, I was kinda counting on her.</i>

00:08:57.460 --> 00:08:59.550
Now, of all times?

00:09:01.680 --> 00:09:04.560
I'll have to go back and try another route.

00:09:12.440 --> 00:09:13.580
Damn it.

00:09:17.840 --> 00:09:19.080
Damn it!

00:09:31.840 --> 00:09:32.750
Damn it!

00:09:33.570 --> 00:09:35.180
It's a dead end!

00:09:35.180 --> 00:09:37.710
This is beyond impossible!

00:09:39.820 --> 00:09:41.410
Crap! An earthquake?!

00:10:09.030 --> 00:10:10.640
Oh, come on...

00:10:11.880 --> 00:10:15.900
<i>Looks like earthworms here 
eat dirt to survive, too,</i>

00:10:15.900 --> 00:10:18.130
<i>just like the ones in our world.</i>

00:10:18.400 --> 00:10:22.040
<i>Not only that, but it's moving in 
a direction I haven't gone yet.</i>

00:10:22.300 --> 00:10:23.740
<i>It poses no threat.</i>

00:10:23.740 --> 00:10:27.280
<i>Given the circumstances, 
I'm damn glad to see it, but...</i>

00:10:29.540 --> 00:10:30.980
It's so slow.

00:10:31.340 --> 00:10:33.490
<i>What is this guy's speed, anyway?</i>

00:10:33.490 --> 00:10:35.900
<i>But I can't get back to the surface now.</i>

00:10:35.900 --> 00:10:38.550
<i>All I can do is trust this 
guy to do the work.</i>

00:10:38.820 --> 00:10:41.730
Hey! Could you pick up the pace a little?

00:10:41.730 --> 00:10:43.560
I don't have much time!

00:10:44.670 --> 00:10:48.520
Hey, nice! Not bad, Wormtarou!

00:10:48.520 --> 00:10:51.420
That's a good boy! 
Just keep plowing through!

00:10:57.260 --> 00:10:59.000
<i>There's a Jirou?!</i>

00:10:59.000 --> 00:11:01.790
Hey! Don't try to take over Tarou's tunnel!

00:11:01.790 --> 00:11:04.010
There's no dirt left for 
you to eat, anyway!

00:11:09.760 --> 00:11:12.190
You want to eat... me?!

