00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:20.990
►An anime series that has been running for 11 years.

00:11:30.030 --> 00:11:32.090
I seriously can't believe this!

00:11:32.320 --> 00:11:36.970
How are Yotsuya and I the only 
ones left at a time like this?

00:11:36.970 --> 00:11:40.160
Iu-san and Kusue-san's revival 
gauges are still stuck at zero...

00:11:40.160 --> 00:11:41.010
Ugh!

