<b>Yotsuya Yuusuke</b>

00:11:43.760 --> 00:11:44.930
<b>Dead</b>

00:11:43.760 --> 00:11:44.930
<b>Reviving in</b>

00:11:44.090 --> 00:11:44.940
What?!

00:11:45.480 --> 00:11:46.340
No way...

00:11:46.350 --> 00:11:49.270
<b>Yotsuya Yuusuke</b>

00:11:46.350 --> 00:11:49.270
<b>Dead</b>

00:11:46.350 --> 00:11:49.270
<b>Reviving in</b>

00:11:46.800 --> 00:11:48.050
What is this?

00:11:53.780 --> 00:11:54.890
<i>Oh, no...</i>

00:11:54.890 --> 00:11:58.110
<i>Both my mind and my body 
are frozen stiff...</i>

00:12:01.530 --> 00:12:02.630
<i>Huh?</i>

00:12:04.440 --> 00:12:07.000
<i>I think... I feel relieved?</i>

00:12:07.000 --> 00:12:08.600
<i>Oh, I get it.</i>

00:12:08.600 --> 00:12:12.880
<i>All this time, I've been wanting 
an excuse to give up.</i>

00:12:12.880 --> 00:12:14.720
<i>I don't want to die,</i>

00:12:15.080 --> 00:12:18.470
<i>but no one can complain if everyone 
else died before me, right?</i>

00:12:19.010 --> 00:12:21.850
<i>And there's no way I can 
finish this on my own.</i>

00:12:22.230 --> 00:12:25.600
<i>I don't have to push myself any farther.</i>

00:12:26.330 --> 00:12:32.430
<i>Wow... Dying the easy way is... so easy...</i>

00:12:34.050 --> 00:12:36.140
Look at you, giving up now!

00:12:36.660 --> 00:12:37.520
Huh?

00:12:38.410 --> 00:12:41.370
Why are you just lying there, Majiha Pink?!

00:12:42.330 --> 00:12:44.520
Majiha... Purple?

00:12:45.140 --> 00:12:47.330
<i>No, this is a dream.</i>

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:49.820
<i>My dying wish to meet them...</i>

00:12:50.280 --> 00:12:54.910
<i>A delusion... A vision in 
the guise of a delusion...</i>

00:12:55.220 --> 00:12:56.610
Majiha Pink!

00:12:57.140 --> 00:12:59.550
You mean... me?

00:13:01.260 --> 00:13:04.480
Whenever you watched us all these 
years, what did you see?

00:13:06.210 --> 00:13:08.750
When the first Majiha Pink was defeated

00:13:08.750 --> 00:13:12.550
by King Lukifel's Darkness Thunder in 
her final episode, what happened next?

00:13:13.790 --> 00:13:15.160
<i>I remember.</i>

00:13:15.470 --> 00:13:16.560
We...

00:13:16.560 --> 00:13:19.290
When the second Majiha Pink was defeated

00:13:19.290 --> 00:13:22.990
by Ouroboros's Energy Stream in her 
final episode, what happened next?

00:13:22.990 --> 00:13:24.360
I remember.

00:13:24.800 --> 00:13:25.910
...give up!

00:13:25.910 --> 00:13:27.980
When the third Majiha Pink was defeated

00:13:27.980 --> 00:13:31.290
by Gorgon's Stone Eyes in her final 
episode, what happened next?

00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:32.990
<i>I saw all of them.</i>

00:13:31.970 --> 00:13:33.340
...give up!

00:13:32.990 --> 00:13:35.210
<i>So I remember it all!</i>

00:13:35.210 --> 00:13:36.830
I'll ask you one more time!

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:40.050
When you watched us all these 
years, what did you see?

00:13:40.050 --> 00:13:40.960
Answer me!

00:13:41.570 --> 00:13:43.140
The Majiha Sisters...

00:13:43.610 --> 00:13:45.060
...always...

00:13:45.060 --> 00:13:48.460
For the love and hope of all 
children around the world...

00:13:49.150 --> 00:13:50.970
...stood back up!

00:14:01.570 --> 00:14:03.950
With my crimson flame, I will burn all!

00:14:04.590 --> 00:14:07.890
Majiha Fire!

00:14:31.560 --> 00:14:32.840
Yuka-san...

00:14:41.030 --> 00:14:43.650
Quickly, come this way.

00:14:48.400 --> 00:14:51.280
I love your smile, Onee-sama.

00:14:51.730 --> 00:14:54.140
Tsu... Tsubasa-kyun...

00:14:54.140 --> 00:14:55.440
Come on, almost there!

00:14:55.440 --> 00:14:56.460
Keep it up!

00:14:56.460 --> 00:14:57.660
Fight on!

00:14:58.630 --> 00:15:00.280
I know you can do it.

00:15:00.280 --> 00:15:01.840
So happy...

00:15:07.820 --> 00:15:09.680
I won't give up.

00:15:10.190 --> 00:15:14.420
I'm a magical girl... after... all...

00:15:14.670 --> 00:15:16.260
If you sleep now, you'll die.

00:15:28.020 --> 00:15:30.060
You're a player, right?

00:15:30.060 --> 00:15:31.700
I'll give you a ride, if you'd like.

00:15:34.080 --> 00:15:35.130
C'mon.

00:15:44.110 --> 00:15:46.360
Wow, you're on the fourth stage?

00:15:46.360 --> 00:15:49.810
Rotten luck, getting hit with 
this snow on your first quest.

00:15:49.810 --> 00:15:50.880
Yeah...

00:15:50.880 --> 00:15:53.220
So, which way do you want to go?

00:15:53.220 --> 00:15:55.050
Oh, right...

00:15:56.140 --> 00:15:58.220
<b>►Traverse 5% of the map (currently 4.996%)</b>

00:15:56.140 --> 00:15:58.220
<b>►Deliver the goods to Radodorbo</b>

00:15:56.140 --> 00:15:58.220
<b>Time remaining: approx. 3 minutes</b>

00:15:57.210 --> 00:15:58.230
No way!

00:15:58.230 --> 00:16:01.130
We're never gonna make it now!

00:16:01.510 --> 00:16:03.050
You're in a hurry?

00:16:05.780 --> 00:16:07.480
It can't be!

00:16:07.480 --> 00:16:10.090
Okay. Big hurry. Got it.

00:16:10.090 --> 00:16:11.650
Better hold on tight, then.

00:16:11.870 --> 00:16:12.330
Huh?

00:16:12.330 --> 00:16:13.570
We're speeding up!

00:16:13.570 --> 00:16:17.790
Wind spirit, Sylphede, lend me your power.

00:16:18.240 --> 00:16:21.650
In the name of the magic 
user Fahtina! Come, wind!

00:16:23.440 --> 00:16:24.620
Huh?!

00:16:24.620 --> 00:16:26.170
How's this work for you?

00:16:26.170 --> 00:16:29.860
U-Uh... are you a player, too?

00:16:29.860 --> 00:16:31.430
Nope, not me.

00:16:31.430 --> 00:16:33.800
I'm just a magic user, that's all.

00:16:33.800 --> 00:16:35.420
A magic user?

00:16:36.500 --> 00:16:37.720
Come, wind!

00:16:41.390 --> 00:16:44.310
<b>►Traverse 5% of the map (currently 4.996%)</b>

00:16:41.390 --> 00:16:44.310
<b>►Deliver the goods to Radodorbo</b>

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:46.720
<i>Please! We're so close!</i>

00:16:49.150 --> 00:16:52.310
Wind, bestow your blessing upon this hero!

