00:17:12.660 --> 00:17:16.110
Huh? N-No way... We're alive?

00:17:16.110 --> 00:17:18.660
Wait, what happened there at the end?

00:17:18.660 --> 00:17:20.240
Who finished the quest?

00:17:22.640 --> 00:17:23.470
You're kidding!

00:17:23.470 --> 00:17:24.810
Yuka-san!

00:17:25.230 --> 00:17:26.980
<i>Th-This is...</i>

00:17:27.390 --> 00:17:30.250
<i>my chance to take all 
the credit for myself!</i>

00:17:30.250 --> 00:17:32.300
<i>If I make them owe me one now...</i>

00:17:32.300 --> 00:17:33.490
Excellent wor.

00:17:34.060 --> 00:17:36.480
Damn it! Don't show up behind me!

00:17:36.480 --> 00:17:40.210
As your reward for completing the 
quest, you may ask one question.

00:17:40.210 --> 00:17:43.610
