girl would bail me out at the last minute...</i>

00:17:54.250 --> 00:17:57.760
<i>We were seriously just seconds from death.</i>

00:17:57.760 --> 00:17:59.910
<i>Who was that magic user?</i>

00:18:00.380 --> 00:18:03.560
<i>No, I won't ask that. 
I can't waste this question.</i>

00:18:08.280 --> 00:18:09.670
This world...

00:18:10.510 --> 00:18:13.090
This world is actually virtual...

00:18:13.560 --> 00:18:16.080
like, virtual reality, right?

00:18:20.700 --> 00:18:22.800
Parallel worlds.

00:18:22.800 --> 00:18:26.150
There is a concept by that na.

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:28.610
<i>Parallel worlds?</i>

00:18:28.920 --> 00:18:31.290
Say, for example, 
that there is an intersection,

00:18:28.920 --> 00:18:39.090
<b>Parallel World</b>

00:18:28.920 --> 00:18:39.090
<b>Reality
Observed World</b>

00:18:31.290 --> 00:18:33.650
and there is a you who 
follows the right path...

00:18:33.650 --> 00:18:39.090
as well as a you in a world based on 
different possibilities who goes left.

00:18:39.430 --> 00:18:44.060
The you in the world based on different 
possibilities who goes left

00:18:44.060 --> 00:18:46.000
exists in a parallel wor.

00:18:46.520 --> 00:18:55.440
<b>Time</b>

00:18:46.520 --> 00:18:55.440
<b>Future←                →Past</b>

00:18:46.760 --> 00:18:51.170
For that reason, 
every time we make a decision,

00:18:51.170 --> 00:18:55.450
the potential number of parallel worlds in 
the universe increases in a branching struc.

00:18:51.480 --> 00:18:55.440
<b>Number of Parallel Worlds</b>

00:18:55.670 --> 00:18:58.230
<i>I guess that does make logical sense.</i>

00:18:58.860 --> 00:19:05.170
Now, what if the me who went 
left died in an accident?

00:19:05.170 --> 00:19:08.780
In a parallel world, I would not have di.

00:19:09.300 --> 00:19:14.470
So what if that decision was made not 
today, but three years from now?

00:19:14.470 --> 00:19:16.330
Among the parallel worlds,

00:19:16.330 --> 00:19:21.360
there would exist a world in 
which I died in an accid.

00:19:21.640 --> 00:19:26.550
And what if the decision was an action 
taken by your parents twenty years ago?

00:19:27.100 --> 00:19:28.650
Among the parallel worlds,

00:19:28.650 --> 00:19:32.470
there would be one in which 
your parents died twenty years ag.

00:19:29.850 --> 00:19:32.480
Nonexistent

