In this way, parallel worlds become 
more and more unrealistic

00:19:40.360 --> 00:19:43.420
the farther they branch out from 
the past from which they origina.

00:19:43.420 --> 00:19:45.060
This branching

00:19:45.060 --> 00:19:49.020
