00:21:05.820 --> 00:21:10.150
are all perfectly real, 
flesh-and-blood beings in realit.

00:21:15.240 --> 00:21:17.520
<i>So the people in this 
world aren't virtual...</i>

00:21:17.930 --> 00:21:21.450
<i>They're Earthlings that just 
